# Play test of the test plan 'CI Plan Recipe' (CIPlay plan_citest, in a test world 'CI ...'): the story from its start,
# each plan island tuned to on the Receiver and played with its own test, the next step unlocked by its quest.
plan CI Plan Recipe
note RadioTower
expect chain RadioTower unlocked
expect chain rock locked
# (the Radio Tower's note - Raft's way on - leads to Signal Rock first)
note Vasagatan
expect chain RadioTower done
expect chain rock unlocked
tune rock
include signal_rock.play
expect chain rock done
expect chain gull unlocked
tune gull
include stranded_gull.play
expect chain gull done
expect chain CaravanTown unlocked
expect chain Balboa locked
plan end
